only (`chs_rt_sys.c`). `oo_sock_raw` calls `oo_cap_require_net` (NetCap
only), then residual Err.

emit-c of `sock_raw` itself: `ERR c_emit unknown free call needs
annotation oo_sock_raw` even with NetCap. Residual emit, not F12.

